pt, TestUS21_Policy_IsolationProfileChangesHash, TestUS21_Approve_ExtensionlessScriptRequiresReview, TestUS21_Policy_IsolationProfileDriftRejectsApproval, TestUS21_Publish_CommitUnknown_KeepsSnapshot, TestUS21_Withdraw_CompensationFailureRecordedUnknown. No entry removed or renamed. The reviewed module-card body is unchanged; an appended revision record (card section 7) documents the deltas. Review-2 return round 2 (2026-11-05): an independent-context re-review of the fix cycle found three residual instances of the same defect classes; all were fixed and proven red first. required_tests extended additively 122 -> 125 with TestUS21_Propose_CommitUnknown_KeepsSnapshot, TestUS21_Withdraw_SupersededCommitUnknownRecorded, TestUS21_Evaluate_TrailingDotScript. No entry removed or renamed; check ids unchanged. The reviewed module-card body is unchanged; an appended revision record (card section 7) documents the deltas.",
